<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">CDTP: A Large-Scale Chinese Data-Text Pair Dataset for Comprehensive Evaluation of Chinese LLMs</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
