<figure id="A4.F8.sf3" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><img src="2510.06039v1/Base_Nature_and_Environment.png" id="A4.F8.sf3.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:548/340;" width="548" height="340" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">(c) </span>CDTP_NE</figcaption>
